---
config:
  htmlLabels: false
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    primaryColor: "#e3f2fd"
    primaryBorderColor: "#90caf9"
    primaryTextColor: "#1a1a1a"
    lineColor: "#546e7a"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#ffffff"
    clusterBkg: "#f5f5f5"
    clusterBorder: "#bdbdbd"
    secondaryColor: "#e8f5e9"
    tertiaryColor: "#f5f5f5"
---
graph TD
    BAM@{shape: doc, label: Input BAM} --> Reads
    SuperRegion[Super Region] --> Reads@{shape: processes, label: "`Reads
for Super Region`"}
    Reference@{shape: doc, label: Reference} --> RefSeq["`Reference Sequence
for Super Region`"]
    Reads --for each--- Read[Read]
    Read --update read metrics--> ReadMetrics[Read Metrics]
    subgraph ReadProcessing[Read Processing]
    Read --trim bases (if specified)--> TrimmedRead[Trimmed Read]
    TrimmedRead --get CIGAR ops--> CIGARs@{shape: processes, label: CIGAR Operations}
    CIGARs --for each--- ProcessCIGAR[Process CIGAR]
    end
    RefSeq --get reference bases--> ProcessCIGAR
    SuperRegion --mark positions of interest in pileup--> InitializePileups["`Initialize Pileup Entries
for Super Region`"]
    InitializePileups --> PileupEntries[Pileup Entries]
    ProcessCIGAR -->|"update pileup entries\n(depths, error counts per position)"| PileupEntries[Pileup Entries]
    PileupEntries --update coverage and accuracy metrics--> CoverageAndAccuracyMetrics[Coverage and Accuracy Metrics]
    ReadMetrics --> Metrics[Metrics]
    CoverageAndAccuracyMetrics --> Metrics
